1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 exd4 4. Nxd4 Qh4 {Rediscovered by me in the summer
of 1971 while researching old openings in the Bodleian Library, which has H.J.
R. Murray's copy of the final edition of Bilguers Handbuch.} 5. Qd3 Nf6 6. Nd2
Ng4 7. N2f3 Qxf2+ 8. Kd1 Qxd4 {I think a couple more moves were made before
Century resigned. His BCF grading was over 200 at the time.} (8... Qxd4 9. Nxd4
Nf2+ 10. Kd2 Nxd3 11. Kxd3 Nxd4 {maybe 0-1 here?} 12. Kxd4) 0-1

